   "attributes": {
    "message": "Updated Oct 21, 2026 at 4:40pm CDT\n\nTwo critical PHP vulnerabilities, CVE-2026-109618 and CVE-2026-109619, were disclosed by the PHP project on October 21 at 14:00 UTC. Patched Chainguard packages and images are available now. We recommend you pull and redeploy any image that includes PHP 8.2 through 8.5. You're patched if your image has php-8.2 8.2.34-r4, php-8.3 8.3.35-r4, php-8.4 8.4.26-r4 or p",
